{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-pre-archimedean-derivation-chain-table1-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:pre-archimedean-derivation-chain-table1-data","kind":"table","title":"Table 1 from prose:pre-archimedean-derivation-chain","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prose-pre-archimedean-derivation-chain"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"pre-archimedean-derivation-chain-table1-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"tbl:pre-archimedean-derivation-chain-table1-data\"></a><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Calibration input</th>\n<th>Measured proxy</th>\n<th>Role</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">m_e</code> — leptonic mass scale (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">h^0</code>)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">m_e</code></td>\n<td>Sets the unit; fixes the <em>scale</em> of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H^1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">P_{\\mathrm{skew}}^{\\beta}</code> — neutron <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta</code>-sector bar-skew channel (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">h^2</code>)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">m_\\mu/m_e</code> (with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{Q}_\\beta = P_{\\mathrm{skew}}^{\\beta}</code>)</td>\n<td>Fixes the substrate parameter <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0</code> (the <em>modulus</em>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">P_{\\mathrm{avg}}^{\\pi}</code> — pion-sector bar-even channel (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">h^3</code>)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">m_\\pi</code></td>\n<td>Fixes the orthogonal meson scale</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/pre-archimedean-derivation-chain-table1-data.md","heading":"Table"}
